Osiris Guide (RuneLite plugin)
==============================

Route content
-------------
The progression route this plugin follows is based on the Ironman guide
originally written by Oziris (@OzirisLoL on X/Twitter) and the community that
maintains https://ironman.guide/ . All credit for the route, ordering, and
strategy belongs to them. This plugin is an unofficial companion and is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or produced by Oziris, ironman.guide, or Jagex.

Game facts (skill levels, item names/ids, quest requirements, coordinates) are
factual data about Old School RuneScape and are not claimed as original work.
The specific curated ordering and any guide wording remain the work of their
authors and are used here for a companion tool; if you are a rights holder and
want a change, open an issue on the repository.

