Reference data
--------------
Some route steps carry precise NPC/object IDs and tile coordinates. These are
factual OSRS game data (not copyrightable) that were harvested at build time from
Quest Helper's open source (BSD 2-Clause, credited above) to save re-mapping
entities by hand. On the `main` branch, Quest Helper's own source code is NOT
shipped — only the resulting factual IDs/coordinates are baked into the route
data. The build-time extractor lives in tools/data/ (qh_extract.py + qh_entities.json).

